				1742,
				2
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Align configuration notification payload with Cocoon expectations\n\nFix two discrepancies between Mountain and its downstream consumers:\n\n- The configuration change Vine notification sent `\"key\": key` (single string), but Cocoon's Configuration.ts expects `\"keys\": [key]` (array) to correctly invalidate cached config entries. Align the payload so extensions like rust-analyzer and ESLint receive accurate change events.\n- The document retrieval call in launch-time model hydration used the outdated `GetAllDocuments()` method; update to `GetAll()` to match current Documents API.\n\nBoth issues were introduced during earlier refactoring phases and went undetected because they only manifest at specific integration points.",
			"SHA": "b4ddf6a32ede0b762c1e4116dce6dd3b38313493"
		},
