			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Notify Cocoon of configuration changes via Vine\n\nForward configuration update events to the extension host (Cocoon) through a Vine notification so that `vscode.workspace.onDidChangeConfiguration` fires for extensions like rust-analyzer, ESLint, and Prettier that react to workspace config changes.\n\nThe notification is fire-and-forget — a Vine send failure must not propagate back and fail the IPC call that the caller (typically a Wind service or Sky command) is awaiting. The changed key is included in the notification payload so Cocoon can scope the change event accordingly.",
			"SHA": "bae7a91ad2610135fe510a56701a73846ae2bcbb"
		}
